sequenceDiagram
    participant ParentAgent as all_model_agent
    participant ConceptualAgent as conceptual_modeller_agent
    participant SearchTools as Search Tools
    actor User

    ParentAgent->>ConceptualAgent: 1. "Create Conceptual Data Model"
    activate ConceptualAgent

    note over ConceptualAgent, SearchTools: 2. Agent uses context variables (e.g., entity_data_model) and calls search tools in parallel to gather information.

    ConceptualAgent->>SearchTools: 3a. call_blueprint_search(...)
    ConceptualAgent->>SearchTools: 3b. call_user_responses_search(...)
    note right of SearchTools: Other tools like ddl_search, google_search, etc., are also available and used as needed.
    
    activate SearchTools
    SearchTools-->>ConceptualAgent: 4. Return search results
    deactivate SearchTools
    
    note right of ConceptualAgent: 5. Agent synthesizes all inputs (context variables, search results) and generates the Conceptual Model artifact.

    ConceptualAgent-->>User: 6. "Here is the generated Conceptual Data Model. Please review."
    
    ConceptualAgent->>ConceptualAgent: 7. Calls 'save_output' tool to save the generated artifact to a file (e.g., conceptual_data_model.txt).
    
    alt User provides feedback by uploading a file
        User->>ConceptualAgent: 8a. Uploads modified file.
        ConceptualAgent->>ConceptualAgent: 9a. Calls 'read_input' tool to process the uploaded file as the new source of truth.
    else User provides verbal go-ahead
        User->>ConceptualAgent: 8b. "Looks good, proceed."
    end

    ConceptualAgent-->>ParentAgent: 10. Returns final result and completion status.
    deactivate ConceptualAgent
